WEBVTT

00:08:56.407 --> 00:09:01.203
is life and the experiences,
the services, the communities

00:09:01.203 --> 00:09:02.997
that we serve,

00:09:03.038 --> 00:09:06.292
and we enter that matter --

00:09:06.333 --> 00:09:07.459
it changes.

00:09:08.794 --> 00:09:11.380
You step out of the matter, it changes.

00:09:12.881 --> 00:09:14.800
So of course you're powerful.

00:09:15.509 --> 00:09:17.011
So why wouldn't your intuition,

00:09:17.011 --> 00:09:18.721
your own thing that you have,

00:09:18.762 --> 00:09:19.888
be powerful?

00:09:21.223 --> 00:09:22.850
I think about that all the time.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:29.773
And perhaps you don't want to take
the big, big swing just yet.